{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"次典范拓扑"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"次典范拓扑"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck拓扑","text":"Grothendieck 拓扑"}},{"Plain":" $J$, 若所有"},{"Local":{"url":"可表函子","text":"可表函子"}},{"Plain":"均为"},{"Local":{"url":"景上的层","text":"层"}},{"Plain":", 即"},{"Local":{"url":"米田嵌入","text":"米田嵌入"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C\\hookrightarrow\\mathsf{Psh}(\\mathcal C)$ 落在"},{"Local":{"url":"层意象","text":"层范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$ 中, 则称 $J$ 为<strong>次典范</strong> (subcanonical) Grothendieck 拓扑.</p>\n<p>最细的次典范拓扑称为<strong>典范拓扑</strong>.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>意象</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"上的典范拓扑正是由"},{"Local":{"url":"意象中的满射","text":"满射"}},{"Plain":"描述的拓扑: 对象 $X$ 的覆盖 $\\{U_i\\to X\\}$ 正是满足 $\\bigsqcup_i U_i \\to X$ 为满射的族.</p>\n"}]}}